  - kind: 2
    emotion: smirk
    text: Don't get too comfortable in that chair. I want the page packed tight,
      and keep the ads away from the political column. I can't afford another fine
      from the Ministry.
    giftId: 
    amount: 1
    optionA: Understood, Boss.
    optionB: Where did they take the Chief?
    next: -1
